# Vendored third-party checkouts (Compound Engineering, pinned by tag in
# .ce/plugin/PINNED_TAG). The converted skills it produces are committed under
# .opencode/skills/, so regenerating is reproducible without vendoring a
# 4.8 MB third-party clone into this history.
.ce/

STOP.md
